---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AuthorSidebar from '../components/AuthorSidebar.astro';
import { AUTHOR } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="page-layout">
    <AuthorSidebar />
    <main class="page-content">
      <h2>Software Engineer. AI Engineer. Technical Founder.</h2>
      <p>
        I build things that actually ship. Then I move on to the next problem.
      </p>

      <h2>What I've Done</h2>
      <ul>
        <li class="metric-blue">
          <strong>AI normalization engine</strong> — Multi-pass LLM pipeline that processes
          unstructured supplier data at scale. Tiered model routing, Claude API, live in
          production. Built this while co-founding Etours Labs.
        </li>
        <li class="metric-green">
          <strong>$133k AUD</strong> — Revenue from a click-and-collect service I helped ship at
          Westfield during Covid. In a pandemic. No pressure.
        </li>
        <li class="metric-red">
          <strong>350k+ SKUs</strong> — Products live on the Westfield Direct marketplace I
          helped build and launch. Order management system processed $800k AUD/month. All on the
          same platform. All real.
        </li>
        <li class="metric-yellow">
          <strong>3 companies co-founded</strong> — Etours, STMI Mediatech, Smitcore. I apparently
          can't stop building things.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>
        16 years shipping real products across e-commerce, marketplaces, booking engines, and
        automation systems — for clients in Australia, New Zealand, and Southeast Asia.
      </p>
      <p>
        I just finished a Masters in Entrepreneurship at the Asian Institute of Management. It
        mostly confirmed what I already suspected: that good technology should solve real
        business problems, not create new ones.
      </p>
      <p>
        I think like a founder because I am one. That means I don't just write code — I
        understand what's behind the ticket.
      </p>
      <p>
        Right now I'm taking on short contracts in software and AI engineering. Python, Django,
        React, LLMs, document extraction, RAG pipelines.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work with a small number of clients at a time. On purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>Work With Me</h2>
      <p>
        1–4 week contracts. AU timezone friendly. Best fit: e-commerce, API integrations, AI
        tooling, automation.
      </p>
      <p>
        If your problem is real and your timeline is tight, we'll get along fine.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you need someone to sit in meetings and look busy — I'm probably not your guy.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={`mailto:${AUTHOR.email}`}>Email me</a> · <a href={AUTHOR.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a> ·
        <a href={AUTHOR.github}>GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
